            "review_title": "Review at Long Monaco",
            "review_text": "Gerrard\nBurnie, Australia53 contributions\n0\nA very nice restaurant with cheap vietnamese meals\nJun 2019 • Couples\nWent down to the food court and found this little restaurant and the staff were friendly but do not speak English very well.The food is really good and local as well and cheap by some of the other local restaurants in the Vincom centre.\nYou had to wait about 10 minutes or so for the food but it was worth the wait and the staff were efficient.\nJust a tip if you use the wet wipes provided you do pay for them so be warned,we take our own tissues.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 25, 2019",
